msgid "This initializes the PIR sensor as an input, sets up serial communication, connects to WiFi, and configures Blynk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_esp01/02-iot_Intrusion_alert_system.rst:240
msgid "We use ``timer.setInterval(1000L, myTimerEvent)`` to set the timer interval in setup(), here we set to execute the ``myTimerEvent()`` function every **1000ms**. You can modify the first parameter of ``timer.setInterval(1000L, myTimerEvent)`` to change the interval between ``myTimerEvent`` executions."
